WEBVTT

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.940
Yay! It's white rice!

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.030
Itadakimasu!

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:11.070
Delicious!

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.280
We get AC here as well.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.280
No one would complain at us lazing off, too!

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:17.990
This is the best!

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:20.830
Y-You little...!

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:26.170
Now, now. Milky Holmes being useless shouldn't be news to us.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.590
By the way, I wonder what's up with the president.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:32.260
Usually she'd come to bail us out.

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.260
She'll probably be here soon!

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:37.640
I have to finish this before she comes!

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:38.680
Thanks for the meal.

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:43.850
We can eat all of these because Sher caused the explosion at Kamakura's Great Detective.

00:00:43.850 --> 00:00:45.140
Nice one, Sher!

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:50.270
Oh please, I just happened to press the switch, that's all!

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:56.240
Get the hell out, you lot!

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:00.240
It's hot...

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:02.370
We got kicked out of heaven.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.160
Huh?

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:04.910
Kamaboko?

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.170
Was he waiting for us to get out the whole time?

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:14.260
Kamaboko, good boy!

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:17.300
On the other hand, what's the prez up to?

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:24.530
Shall we look for her in her room, which has cold juice and air conditioning?

00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:26.310
Agreed!

00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:47.870
<i>Milky Holmes... My only rival...</i>

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.840
<i>No one could keep it up against me.</i>

00:01:52.670 --> 00:01:56.300
<i>Even with treasure in hand, I felt empty.</i>

00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:00.640
<i>That's when they came along and fired me up.</i>

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.100
<i>I've got a gift for you!</i>

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.560
<i>Here, a flower of hope!</i>

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:10.440
We're back!

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.440
Oh?

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:12.980
Henriette-san?

00:02:12.980 --> 00:02:15.030
Aren't you going to turn the lights on?

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.370
Did you know? We were behind bars for days!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.700
I accidentally detonated a bomb inside Kamakura's Great Detective!

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:29.040
But the detention cell was like heaven on earth!

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:32.960
We had pickled radishes as a side dish.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:36.670
Henriette-san?

00:02:44.510 --> 00:02:45.890
Please stop this!

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:48.270
If you drink Oolong tea like that―!

00:02:48.270 --> 00:02:51.100
I can't believe you'd get this drunk from Oolong tea!

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:54.020
Oolong tea... is bad for you...

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:58.780
Oolong tea tastes good and all, but too much of it is bad for your health!

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:01.740
What I drink is my business.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:09.330
Please don't get so upset just because your homework piled up over summer vacation!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.920
Eh, your homework piled up?

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.000
Like that would happen. She's not you, Nero.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.250
Don't speak about me like that!

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:20.630
You're best off smiling, Henriette-san!

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:25.260
Please leave. Now.

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:35.980
You don't have to work so hard.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.900
It's better to be the only one rather than number one!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.490
Being useless is a habit!

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:43.950
Even if you're more useless than us,

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.950
just believe in this flower of hope.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:57.590
Henriette-san!

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:21.780
Everyone.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.490
You must be hungry, right?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.990
Let's have supper.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.670
So many goodies!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.880
How did it end up like this?

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.840
There's plenty more, so take your time!

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:47.180
Yes!

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:48.970
Yum!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.430
I wonder what this is for, though.

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:56.100
Obviously it's to praise me, Akechi Kokoro, the genius girl!

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.020
Not a chance.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:00.900
Uploading to Facehmph.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:06.990
What is she thinking, giving Milky Holmes such a feast...

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.780
They'd just take advantage of her kindness, anyways.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:16.710
Don't you understand? Henriette-sama's planning to degrade Milky Holmes!

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:21.050
I see! She's planning to degrade them by letting them taste heaven!

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:26.010
If that's the case, I need to make something they'll never forget!

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.430
I'll help you out.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:30.640
Beautiful Me will also help out!

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.140
Now, decorate my BEAUTIFUL body!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:39.690
I want more! Bananas and dumplings, for example!

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.400
I want to eat ramen!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.110
Please enjoy yourselves thoroughly.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.740
This is the last supper.

00:05:48.910 --> 00:05:50.740
What does that mean?

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.990
We apologize for the interruption, but we have urgent news.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:56.620
We have received a threat from Phantom Thief Arsène.

00:05:56.620 --> 00:06:00.080
She claims that she will demolish Holmes Detective Academy tonight.

00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:02.170
Heh?

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.920
Demolish!?

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.670
Didn't she mean "steal" ...?

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:09.890
Henriette-sama...

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:18.890
This is Akechi Kokoro, the Yokohama Police's genius girl with an IQ of 14,000,000,000,000!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:22.360
The whole school must obey my orders.

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:25.280
Wait, where are the rest of the students!?

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:27.820
It's summer vacation. It can't be helped.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:30.860
Apparently, most of them are back in their hometowns.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.450
What a useless lot!

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.490
Oh well, I didn't need a shield in the first place.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:36.950
By the way...

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:38.580
Kokoro-chan!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.080
Net!?

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.580
Ram!?

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:46.170
Hole!?

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.550
Pots!?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:52.970
I set up traps like that, so do your best to avoid them.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:53.550
And...

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.060
Don't call me Kokoro-chan!

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:00.100
I don't see the need in detectives,

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.940
and I don't mind if the academy gets crushed,

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:06.150
but this is my job so I'll have to help you lot out.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:08.150
Cry tears of joy!

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:10.570
Kokoro-san, you're being too obvious.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:14.070
Why is Akechi giving us orders, anyways?

00:07:14.070 --> 00:07:15.530
What's the President doing?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.000
Oh, right. We haven't seen her around.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.790
Where is she hiding?

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.790
Students of Holmes Detective Academy.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.880
I'll take the lead from here.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.420
Please give me your cooperation.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:33.510
As long as the President is with us, Arsène is nothing!

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.300
I devote myself to the President!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.930
Didn't I just say that <i>I'll</i> take control!?

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.810
Listen to me!

00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.350
It can't be helped.

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:44.150
The prez is more reliable.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.440
Girls vs. women, after all.

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.190
Rage!!

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.110
Henriette-san!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:06.250
The Student Council President of Holmes Detective Academy is no match for me.

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:07.500
It can't be!

00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:10.130
Arsène?

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:14.470
Phantom Thief Arsène! Give us our President back!

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.970
I'll have you arrested today for sure! Tsugiko, Hirano, Saku!

00:08:16.970 --> 00:08:18.060
Right!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:18.600
Yes!

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:19.850
Alrighty-o.

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:23.810
Milky Holmes! Move out!

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.660
Police force, attack!

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.630
We'll protect the Detective Academy-oink!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.750
Toys of Resplendence.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:57.340
Arsène!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:08:59.350
Arsène!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.600
Stop there, Arsène!

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:08.270
Time to get what's coming to you-oink!

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:10.400
I'll catch you here and now-oink!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:11.360
Oink?

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:14.070
Phantom Thief Arsène! You're going in jail!

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:15.200
Wait!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.490
That Arsène looks different than usual.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:25.000
Lard charge!

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.460
20000 kcal!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.330
The mark of a pig's vow to a sword!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.710
That's Phantom Thief Arsène no matter how you look at her!

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:32.800
My eyes never lie!

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.590
There's no way we'd mistake someone else for Arsène!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.630
That's... Arsène...

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.260
You're under arrest!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.720
Wait!

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:45.350
What's Arsène-sama thinking?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:49.020
She usually steals first and destroys later! This isn't like her!

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:51.730
Arsène! You're under arrest!

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:56.740
This is Arsène-sama we're talking about. She must have a reason for this.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.110
What reason?

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:59.490
T-That's...

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:05.410
T-There must be treasure hidden near the school!

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:07.040
It must be! It has to be!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:11.420
If that is so, this is not the place to be gushing oil!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.460
Yeah, let's go too!

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.630
Wait, that's...

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.800
You're cornered, Arsène!

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:23.640
You're so afraid of Akechi Kokoro that you're at a loss for words!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:26.680
Huh?

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.440
Wake up!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.360
Don't move!

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:38.400
My G4 has gracefully broken out of your illusions!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:41.200
Except the one who broke it for us is Poporo Mark II.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.620
Stop your futile resistance and give up!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.830
Futile resistance?

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.380
Are you mistaking me for yourselves?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:01.760
Shut him up.

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:02.340
I can't.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:06.350
I'll show you just how deadly martial arts and bullets are together!

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:16.780
She's playing with us!

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:18.320
We do have a secret weapon...

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:19.150
Beep!

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:22.450
Secret weapon? What the hell is this crap!?

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.950
Human Cannon: Kokoro Bomber.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.330
Why do I have to be the bom―

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:34.500
Don't dodge me!!

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:45.140
Ow... What happened?

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:50.430
My beloved You!

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.940
The laundry...

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.150
Why is Arsène-sama going so far?

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.950
No, there must be a deeper meaning behind this.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.320
There must be. There has to be!

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:06.410
Am I right?

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.370
Arsène-sama, please tell us where the treasure is!

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:11.120
We will help out too!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.540
Treasure? There's no such thing.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.000
Then why are you doing this?

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:22.470
I felt like crushing Holmes Detective Academy with my own hands.

00:12:22.470 --> 00:12:23.720
That's all.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.940
As the one most loyal to you, my master,

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.650
Arsène-sama, I shall open your eyes!

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:42.650
Back off!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.360
What the hell are you doing!?

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:49.660
Pointing a blade at Arsène-sama is traitorous to the max!

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:52.290
Are you pointing your sword at me?

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.500
I guess that's fine too.

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.500
All three of you. Come at me.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:02.510
What are you on about? This isn't like the Arsène-sama we know!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:09.350
<i>If you wish to commit yourselves as phantom thieves,
then duel not with power, but with beauty and intelligence.</i>

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:12.930
<i>The jewels you steal are in misery.</i>

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.480
That's right, this isn't being a Phantom Thief!

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:20.020
This isn't how the beautiful Arsène-sama does things!

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.360
We must guide her right.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.780
Rat! Twenty!

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:26.610
We swear allegiance to Arsène-sama,

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:28.660
to protect her,

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.080
and side with her.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.660
We are knights brought together for that reason;

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.870
we are the Phantom Thief Empire!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.120
That, as of today, will disband.

00:13:38.120 --> 00:13:40.090
I shall leave Yokohama.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:42.840
What do you mean!?

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:44.800
I've said it already.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.930
What are you saying??

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:48.050
I won't take that as an answer!

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:51.300
If you manage to defeat me, then I'll take that back.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:52.640
Can you?

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:01.360
Even if it costs me my life, I'll stop Arsène-sama!

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.110
We just need to beat you, right?

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:08.450
I'm starting to get excited.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.750
What do you mean, disband!?

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.630
Leave Yokohama?

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:33.180
I'll win! I'll win and stop you!

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.150
What were we doing...?

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:42.980
So you're finally awake from the illusion?

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:48.030
Why are they fighting?

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:51.320
No! Not with attacks like these!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.240
Turn into a doll!

00:14:56.200 --> 00:15:00.120
Super ultra proud dangerous wonderful joker!

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:02.420
Ain't I wonderful!?

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.960
Sword art, Dragon Tiger Dance!

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.220
Rat Fire!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:18.560
Did we get her?

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.530
You have become stronger.

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:29.820
Not a single scratch?

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.660
Thunder.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.290
I'm charred!

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:40.710
A real lightning strike?

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.710
Her illusions turned into reality?

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:45.420
Her Toys have powered up.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.880
You want more, don't you?

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:52.630
Evening Star, Venus!

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:58.640
Yes!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.430
Ultima.

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.280
L-La France!

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:17.160
It's Rat. Rat.

00:16:18.240 --> 00:16:20.330
You said you'd lend me money!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:22.790
You said you'd become my guarantor!

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:24.120
I didn't...

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.880
Don't die on me, La France!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:29.460
Ra...t...

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:32.920
La France!!

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.260
We'll never win one on one.

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:39.600
Give me a hand!

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:44.020
How sweet of you. Very well...

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.860
This'll be our first time doing it together!

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:48.060
Don't put it like that!

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.160
Secret Skill Handjob!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.700
Triceratops @% Fist!

00:17:01.700 --> 00:17:04.790
Our first time doing it―!

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.670
Nāga!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:19.890
Are you alive?

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:21.010
Of course!

00:17:22.020 --> 00:17:25.890
Ishinagare Jiggle-Jiggle Tri-Handjob Fist!!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:36.710
Let's go too!

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:37.820
Lightning!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.200
Twenty?

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.580
To think she's this powerful...

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.340
I'll admit, you are strong.

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.220
However, the sad truth is that I'm stronger.

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:05.060
The Phantom Thief Empire is hereby disbanded.

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:08.190
Arsène... sama....

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.450
Phantom Thief Arsène!

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:19.030
You're under arrest!

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:20.780
You won't get away!

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:22.580
We're your opponents!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:25.330
Please give up and surrender!

00:18:29.580 --> 00:18:32.210
We won't let you destroy the academy just yet!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:37.340
Sherlock Shellingford.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.550
Just what are you?

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.060
I'm a Milky Holmes.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:45.180
Detecti―

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:06.510
Goodbye, Milky Holmes.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.390
Forever.
